Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:08.62,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Megafloat Japan and Megafloat \NWest USA are presently...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:12.40,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,...300 kilometers east of Amami \NOoshima, heading northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:15.53,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,We have liberated Guam and Okinawa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:18.38,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,and are getting closer \Nto the Japanese mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:20.50,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,It's finally time for the mainland battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:24.09,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,We will take back Japan, our home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:26.38,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Our target is the capital, Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:04.72,Episode,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,750)}Episode 9
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:04.72,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,750)}Academy Festa -First Live-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:05.02,HybridTop,K,0000,0000,0000,,On Wednesdays and Fridays, the beef bowls\Nat the cafeteria have less sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:07.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,And on Thursdays, the portions get smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.70,0:02:11.77,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,If you overlap the part-timers' \Nshifts on top of it like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:15.45,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,you'll see that when Suzuki-san \Nis working, you get extra sauce,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:16.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,but when Yamamoto-san is working...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:18.03,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,No one cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:21.53,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,There's other stuff to talk about, right?\NLike... you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.23,0:02:26.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I figured this would be more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.49,HybridMain,All,0000,0000,0000,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:31.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:32.17,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:45.53,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,These are life-sized data figures,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:48.62,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,made from my experience and analysis\Nperforming Heart Hybrids...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:50.46,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...during actual combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:55.43,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The models use log data from the love room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:58.44,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,They're more than 97 percent accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:02.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,This is an erogenous zone map,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:06.08,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,created using my activities during \Nthe Heart Hybrids and their responses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:08.41,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Erogenous zones?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:09.60,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what that means!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.64,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what it means, \Nbut it sounds amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:14.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,However, they don't always \Nreact in an identical manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:18.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The way it feels to them is very different \Ndepending on the strength used
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,and friction coefficients.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:21.43,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna Hida is a terrifying man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.55,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,How much experience does he have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.72,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The girl's psychological state,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.60,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,as well as the situation you set, \Nalso change things drastically.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:33.85,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Different individuals react differently, \Nso there's no general theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.48,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Each case requires its \Nown individual decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.69,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm totally lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:40.53,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But there's something more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.53,0:03:41.70,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.99,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,To understand the feelings of the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:46.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What they wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:48.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What they're seeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:51.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You need to sense that and\Nchoose the appropriate methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:53.42,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,He's no amateur!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.21,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,He's a pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.71,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Pro Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:57.00,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,For example...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.76,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,This is data from Himekawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.55,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,during our attack on the \NSuper-Category Class Tri-Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:10.42,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:20.90,HybridNote,,0000,0000,0000,,Ataraxia Academy Festa
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:23.38,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,It's your last chance to relax\Nbefore the big battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:26.16,sign_6322_58_Holiday,R,0000,0000,0000,,Holiday
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:26.16,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Go enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.05,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,You're enjoying yourself \Na little too much, idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:47.09,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I've finished presenting my science project\Nfor the first day of the academy festa...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'll go check out \Nwhat everyone's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:04.82,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Well? Did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.70,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.33,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We can't do our rehearsal like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:12.22,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:13.83,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:15.66,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.71,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:19.88,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,don't grab onto him every time you see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.96,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, did you get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:26.76,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.64,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:32.51,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't Hayuru just go talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:36.06,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kizuna-kun was doing a lewd presentation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:38.02,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't have time to tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.19,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,It's time for rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:41.69,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,but there's no sign of Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:42.52,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Of Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.90,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,We had everyone go look for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.53,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,but nobody can find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You try using the PA system?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.99,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,We sure did.\NMade an Ataraxia-wide announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.29,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,But no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.66,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,She's either asleep or hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:57.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.71,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:01.17,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You two start the rehearsal without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:09.80,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But how am I supposed to\Nfind her in this crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:14.56,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's Mister Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:16.31,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The hell are you doing, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:17.98,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Gertrude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:20.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.58,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:27.44,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No way in hell I'm spending \Nthe festival in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.69,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Well, don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.45,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:33.20,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Have you seen Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.37,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I tried every food stall out here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:39.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't see Aine-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.71,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe the slut's in the school building?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:44.17,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:45.30,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:59.89,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. Have you seen\NAine Chidorigafuchi from Class 2-A?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.56,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's Eros!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:06.90,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It is him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:08.90,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Run, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:10.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.66,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I don't—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:19.41,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:21.83,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What's wrong, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:22.83,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:23.54,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:26.75,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,This is my class!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:29.05,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,But where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:31.72,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:38.77,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:39.85,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:46.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Just in case we can't find Aine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:47.65,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I brought you a substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:50.19,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:54.41,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna-kun, that's not fair to Sylvia-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:57.70,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia-chan, let's practice a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:59.41,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:01.96,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I-I can't! It's too sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:04.88,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go look for Aine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.63,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.84,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:17.26,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:22.43,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Now you can test-fire the Engineering \NDivision's latest railgun with no wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:24.23,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Eros Overlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:26.98,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:29.11,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Kizuna Hida!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:31.28,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What's your problem?\NThat was a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.11,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It was not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:36.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That aside, have you seen Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.85,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.74,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I haven't seen her come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:41.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:43.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, while you're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:47.21,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Want to try our new railgun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.71,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm in a hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:50.84,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Just come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:55.22,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's not going to just blow up, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:58.51,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not. Don't underestimate \NMomo Kurumizawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:00.64,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,the Engineering Division's top student!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.60,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:05.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I've got stuff to do,\Nso I'll only fire the one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:08.02,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing difficult you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:08.90,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.94,0:09:11.73,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Put the target in the middle of the sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:12.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,and flip the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Flip the switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:29.67,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Shikina-san, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:37.99,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:39.57,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.06,HybridNote,,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:51.44,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:53.94,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You're the Masters...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:56.17,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's you, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:58.45,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Did you come to see me in my maid outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:01.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,In this café,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.09,0:10:03.33,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,you're the master of the Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.83,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Order a lot, okay, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:09.06,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:16.36,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What will you order, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:17.88,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:21.36,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, I'm not here for tea...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:22.69,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm looking for Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:26.29,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We recommend this menu right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.60,sign_15036_172_Moe_Menu_Lap_Pil,,0000,0000,0000,,Moe Menu\N{\fs16}Lap Pillow\NEar Picking\NInstant Photo\NPolaroid\NSlap\NAbuse\NHug\NPatting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:32.71,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We also have a secret menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:34.11,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:35.63,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:37.36,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,This maid café is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:41.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:42.78,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I remembered something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:45.10,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Here's your receipt, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.35,0:10:49.28,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That's expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:51.60,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It includes the fee for the \Ninformation we gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:52.85,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't give me any information...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:01.24,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost time for the concert to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.03,0:11:04.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Where did she go, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.34,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to kill me, then do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:26.76,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,General Grabel of the \N6th Expeditionary Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:31.33,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You've gone from hero to traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:35.84,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,She decided on her own to make contact \Nwith the Lemurian barbarians,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:39.98,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,discovered Zeros and yet said nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:43.36,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,and tried to keep it for \Nherself, the traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:47.16,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros is in Lemuria?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:50.20,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Put together a fleet immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:54.61,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Get Zeros if it means killing \Nevery single Lemurian!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:57.88,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,We've conquered more than enough of Lemuria!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:12:00.80,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,What is the point of more murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:04.26,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,There are civilians there, not just soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.79,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.97,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Compared to what we seek,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:12.68,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,their lives are meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:18.11,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,I was originally a soldier of a country \Nthat was conquered by Batlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:38.29,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,S-Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:46.55,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,I can't allow you to invade...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:49.20,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...or oppress them for no reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:54.18,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:58.73,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll let you taste heaven without dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:12.70,HybridItalics,G,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.41,HybridItalics,G,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:19.96,HybridItalics,G,0000,0000,0000,,I should only feel hate and pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:21.42,HybridItalics,G,0000,0000,0000,,so why do I feel so...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:40.65,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:53.83,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.39,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,Surrendering already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:56.86,HybridItalics,G,0000,0000,0000,,Endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:59.29,HybridItalics,G,0000,0000,0000,,Aldea will come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:01.17,HybridItalics,G,0000,0000,0000,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:07.78,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You think your friend will come for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:22.69,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Zelshione-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.69,0:14:25.67,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Please, show me more love!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:27.44,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:30.68,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm your pet, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:33.68,HybridMain,G,0000,0000,0000,,Mind control?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:35.78,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:39.16,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you my pet as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:40.69,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Bronze Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:45.94,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,First, you're going to \Ntell me where Zeros is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:57.14,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to Lemuria.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:15:00.23,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Our target is their mobile fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:04.51,HybridMain,Nayuta,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait a moment, Zelshione-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:06.65,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:10.93,sign_21806_232_Performing_on_th,,0000,0000,0000,,Performing on the special stage on the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:12.72,sign_21806_231_Amaterasu,,0000,0000,0000,,Amaterasu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:19.70,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Now, it's time for a special \Nacademy festa performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.41,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,They're usually a combat group,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:22.73,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,but just for today...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.32,HybridItalics,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,...they're school idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:27.74,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,No sign of Aine-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:30.24,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:32.97,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:38.47,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Give a big hand to the idols\Nof Ataraxia, Amaterasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:45.94,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's started, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:49.40,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Where did she go, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:54.45,HybridTop,Y,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:55.03,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Something was bothering her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:58.12,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:00.77,HybridTop,H,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}H-Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.77,HybridTop,S,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Excuse me! I'm standing in for Aine-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:05.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:07.71,HybridTop,S,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm Sylvia Silkcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:09.80,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Is she going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:15.43,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:18.93,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:26.17,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, everybody, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:37.86,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Why are you\Nsitting here by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.49,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I told you before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:44.86,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That each time I do a Heart Hybrid,\Nsome of my memories come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:45.85,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:50.42,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe they might not be memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.32,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:56.76,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I searched the database for the things I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:01.33,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But they don't exist anywhere on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.14,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It's like another world...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:09.61,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Don't think too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:11.82,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Take back hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:16.82,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Another... world...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:18.32,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.91,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to remember any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:25.31,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm not going to do \Nany more Heart Hybrids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:29.69,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But your Hybrid Count is getting low.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:33.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't do it, your count \Nwill drop to zero in the next fight—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:34.21,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:35.63,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.82,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to remember\Nany more strange things!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:43.56,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like if I do,\NI won't be the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:45.18,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:47.73,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:50.13,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens,\Nyou are who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:51.52,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.29,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:18.59,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what's in your past, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:20.59,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,We won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:23.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You'll always be one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:29.06,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,To me, you're no one but Aine Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:35.02,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll shoot you through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.02,0:18:38.53,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A burning hot gaze...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:43.53,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Get closer to me and make it\Nso you're only mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:45.81,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,My heart's beating so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:47.83,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:07.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Don't hide them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.31,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:19.99,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Does it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:22.30,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.08,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You know it feels good...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:36.84,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:45.83,HybridMain,Singers,0000,0000,0000,,Love Gun High Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:25.95,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:32.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:36.65,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:44.45,HybridMain,Singers,0000,0000,0000,,Seven loves shooting through the heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:58.17,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Captain, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:07.09,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:08.89,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:11.35,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Amaterasu needs to emergency scramble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:14.35,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,An enemy fleet has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:19.71,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy fleet has come from \Nthe Kanto area of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,If we want to take back Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:27.61,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,we have to fight them at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.61,0:21:28.41,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:31.66,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:32.87,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Someone's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.80,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Why is she there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:47.88,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:53.93,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a long time, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:46.43,Illustration,,0000,0000,0000,,Illustration: Yumi Nakata
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:28.48,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That woman was always in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.48,0:23:32.17,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,And so were her cold eyes that always\Nlooked down on, mocked, and derided others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:35.34,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Nayuta Hida, I will never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:46.43,Next Episode Title,,0001,0001,0160,,Next time: Eve of the Decisive Battle -Install-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.73,0:23:37.38,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what the cost,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.38,0:23:39.50,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,no matter if it costs me my soul...
